    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Motion Design Director, now at OpenAI (in-house design team; per Jonathan via LinkedIn, 2026). Previously Motion Design Director at COLLINS (NYC/SF); he had collaborated with OpenAI's design team on motion/sound for a ChatGPT launch sizzle before joining full-time. Lithuanian-born, Brooklyn-based. ~14 yrs experience: Motion Designer at TAPE (2011-12), freelance (2012-14), Designer at 2x4 (2014-17), Art Director at Hugo & Marie (2017-18), freelance (2018-19), COLLINS, then OpenAI. Senior / director-level motion identity pedigree: Bose rebrand, Prada, Nike, HBO, Netflix, Met. Autonomy 4 (leads motion direction independently at a senior level within a larger team). IG @tomasmarkevicius; site tomasmarkevicius.com. Captured work predates the OpenAI move (COLLINS-era projects).",
